WEBVTT

NOTE Original complete video/audio are preserved.
Source speech alignment and confirmed corrections are recorded privately.

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.400 line:8% position:50% align:center size:90%
I stop to think about everything
that happened during the day.

2
00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:05.700 line:8% position:50% align:center size:90%
I say: folks, how did I manage it?

3
00:00:06.200 --> 00:00:10.200 line:8% position:50% align:center size:90%
I got to see my family again,
after more than five years apart.

4
00:00:10.400 --> 00:00:13.400 line:8% position:50% align:center size:90%
I traded my bread for medication.

5
00:00:13.400 --> 00:00:15.400 line:8% position:50% align:center size:90%
I weighed 179 kg.

6
00:00:16.400 --> 00:00:20.400 line:8% position:50% align:center size:90%
I couldn't sit for five minutes,
or stand for five minutes.

7
00:00:20.600 --> 00:00:21.400 line:8% position:50% align:center size:90%
Cutting myself.

8
00:00:22.400 --> 00:00:26.200 line:8% position:50% align:center size:90%
I attempted suicide on
August 21 last year.

9
00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:29.600 line:8% position:50% align:center size:90%
I really almost died.

10
00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:35.600 line:8% position:50% align:center size:90%
It was hard for me. I'm afraid.
I don't want that in my life anymore.

11
00:00:36.200 --> 00:00:37.200 line:8% position:50% align:center size:90%
But even so,

12
00:00:37.400 --> 00:00:40.400 line:8% position:50% align:center size:90%
I didn't want to disappoint
myself, or the person

13
00:00:40.400 --> 00:00:42.600 line:8% position:50% align:center size:90%
who put their trust in me.

14
00:00:43.200 --> 00:00:46.000 line:8% position:50% align:center size:90%
But I couldn't. It was stronger than me.

15
00:00:46.400 --> 00:00:49.100 line:8% position:50% align:center size:90%
If someone said something,
if something frustrated me,

16
00:00:49.600 --> 00:00:51.400 line:8% position:50% align:center size:90%
say, at school, if I,

17
00:00:51.400 --> 00:00:54.170 line:8% position:50% align:center size:90%
if I didn't score 20 on a test,
I was already frustrated.

18
00:00:54.200 --> 00:00:56.800 line:8% position:50% align:center size:90%
It already made me want to hurt myself.

19
00:00:57.400 --> 00:00:59.400 line:8% position:50% align:center size:90%
We started with humility, right?

20
00:01:00.200 --> 00:01:02.800 line:8% position:50% align:center size:90%
I saw that I didn't have humility,

21
00:01:03.200 --> 00:01:07.200 line:8% position:50% align:center size:90%
because, little by little,
I'm gaining humility.

22
00:01:07.400 --> 00:01:11.800 line:8% position:50% align:center size:90%
because we think we're humble,
but we're really not.

23
00:01:12.200 --> 00:01:15.200 line:8% position:50% align:center size:90%
And gentleness. Gentleness
helped me a lot, too.

24
00:01:15.600 --> 00:01:16.800 line:8% position:50% align:center size:90%
because I was like this:

25
00:01:17.200 --> 00:01:21.800 line:8% position:50% align:center size:90%
if someone said something that hurt me,
wow, I wanted to answer straight away,

26
00:01:22.000 --> 00:01:26.800 line:8% position:50% align:center size:90%
to shout, kick, even hit
my head with a stool,

27
00:01:27.000 --> 00:01:29.400 line:8% position:50% align:center size:90%
to do all sorts of things to myself.

28
00:01:29.600 --> 00:01:31.600 line:8% position:50% align:center size:90%
Not today. Today I take a deep breath,

29
00:01:31.800 --> 00:01:33.400 line:8% position:50% align:center size:90%
I count to five.

30
00:01:33.600 --> 00:01:36.400 line:8% position:50% align:center size:90%
I'm cured. I'm winning
one day after another.

31
00:01:36.800 --> 00:01:39.400 line:8% position:50% align:center size:90%
Whenever I get nervous like that,

32
00:01:39.600 --> 00:01:41.800 line:8% position:50% align:center size:90%
the urge doesn't even
cross my mind anymore.

33
00:01:43.000 --> 00:01:43.800 line:8% position:50% align:center size:90%
And that's it.

34
00:01:51.200 --> 00:01:54.000 line:8% position:50% align:center size:90%
And today I see that love
of neighbor does exist.

35
00:01:54.600 --> 00:01:58.000 line:8% position:50% align:center size:90%
And I believe no one is beyond recovery.

36
00:01:58.000 --> 00:02:03.000 line:8% position:50% align:center size:90%
[Music]
